  "name": "Operations Network B",
  "cellSizeM": 2.0,
  "notes": [
    "Tier 2 with stepped lanes: each route zigzags once or twice instead of running straight.",
    "Route A: conveyor on the central run (A2), a patrolled loop below the run, and an MFA/keypad/hardened gate at A3.",
    "Route B: cart ride on the lower run (B2), gate at B3, service/paired hazard at B4.",
    "Route C: a service/paired hazard early (C2), conveyor mid-route (C3), gate near the end (C4).",
    "A3, B3 and C4 accept the carried T1_MAINT permission as a shortcut. Zero-day reward at the hub cell [3,11].",
    "Exit trigger is cell [47,13]; one fixed camera at [48,11]."
  ],
